 Hello←{
     ⍝ POST /Hello   body: {"name":"Ann"}   →   {"message":"Hello, Ann!"}
     ⍝ The simplest endpoint: the JSON body arrives as ⍵ (an object becomes
     ⍝ a namespace), and the result is sent back as JSON.
     name←{0::'world' ⋄ ⍵.name}⍵         ⍝ no name given? greet the world
     r←⎕NS ⍬
     r.message←'Hello, ',name,'!'
     r
 }
